{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++17 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++17 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <cstdio>\n#include <cmath>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nusing ll = long long;\nusing VI = vector<int>;\n\nconst ll MOD = 1000000007;\nconst ll MOD2 = 998244353;\n\nVI pos[7];\nll pw[15], s[7];\nll cnt2, n;\nint ans = 0;\n\nint query(int fixpre, ll val) {\n    ll res = 0;\n    for (int d = 0; d < 7; ++d) {\n        ll base = 1LL * fixpre * pw[d];\n        ll offset = (val - base) % MOD2;\n        if (offset < 0) offset += MOD2;\n        int p = lower_bound(pos[d].begin(), pos[d].end(), MOD2 - offset) - pos[d].begin();\n        res = (res + s[d] + offset * (ll)pos[d].size() - MOD2 * ((ll)pos[d].size() - p)) % MOD;\n    }\n    return (int)(res % MOD);\n}\n\nvoid dfs(int val, int d) {\n    int x = (cnt2 - val + MOD2) % MOD2;\n    pos[d].push_back(x);\n    cnt2++;\n    s[d] = (s[d] + x) % MOD2;\n    if (d == 6) return;\n    for (int i = 0; i < 10; ++i) {\n        dfs(val * 10 + i, d + 1);\n    }\n}\n\nvoid dfs2(ll val) {\n    if (val * 1000000 + 999999 <= n && val * 10000000 > n) {\n        ans = (ans + query(val, cnt2 + 1)) % MOD;\n        cnt2 += cnt2;\n    } else {\n        cnt2++;\n        ll diff = (cnt2 - val) % MOD2;\n        if (diff < 0) diff += MOD2;\n        ans = (ans + (int)diff) % MOD;\n        int start = val ? 0 : 1;\n        for (int i = start; i < 10; ++i) {\n            if (val * 10 + i <= n) {\n                dfs2(val * 10 + i);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nint main() {\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n    \n    cnt2 = 0;\n    dfs(0, 0);\n    for (int i = 0; i < 7; ++i) {\n        sort(pos[i].begin(), pos[i].end());\n    }\n    pw[0] = 1;\n    for (int i = 1; i < 13; ++i) {\n        pw[i] = pw[i - 1] * 10;\n    }\n    cin >> n;\n    cnt2 = -1;\n    dfs2(0);\n    cout << ans << '\\n';\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static final long MOD = 1000000007;\n    static final long MOD2 = 998244353;\n    \n    static List<Long>[] pos = new List[7];\n    static long[] pw = new long[15];\n    static long[] s = new long[7];\n    static long cnt2;\n    static long n;\n    static int ans = 0;\n    \n    @SuppressWarnings(\"unchecked\")\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        n = Long.parseLong(br.readLine());\n        \n        for (int i = 0; i < 7; i++) {\n            pos[i] = new ArrayList<>();\n        }\n        \n        cnt2 = 0;\n        dfs(0, 0);\n        for (int i = 0; i < 7; i++) {\n            Collections.sort(pos[i]);\n        }\n        pw[0] = 1;\n        for (int i = 1; i < 13; i++) {\n            pw[i] = pw[i - 1] * 10;\n        }\n        cnt2 = -1;\n        dfs2(0);\n        System.out.println(ans);\n    }\n    \n    static int query(int fixpre, long val) {\n        long res = 0;\n        for (int d = 0; d < 7; ++d) {\n            long base = 1L * fixpre * pw[d];\n            long offset = (val - base) % MOD2;\n            if (offset < 0) offset += MOD2;\n            int p = lowerBound(pos[d], MOD2 - offset);\n            res = (res + s[d] + offset * pos[d].size() - MOD2 * (pos[d].size() - p)) % MOD;\n        }\n        return (int)(res % MOD);\n    }\n    \n    static int lowerBound(List<Long> list, long target) {\n        int left = 0, right = list.size();\n        while (left < right) {\n            int mid = (left + right) / 2;\n            if (list.get(mid) < target) {\n                left = mid + 1;\n            } else {\n                right = mid;\n            }\n        }\n        return left;\n    }\n    \n    static void dfs(int val, int d) {\n        long x = (cnt2 - val + MOD2) % MOD2;\n        pos[d].add(x);\n        cnt2++;\n        s[d] = (s[d] + x) % MOD2;\n        if (d == 6) return;\n        for (int i = 0; i < 10; ++i) {\n            dfs(val * 10 + i, d + 1);\n        }\n    }\n    \n    static void dfs2(long val) {\n        if (val * 1000000 + 999999 <= n && val * 10000000 > n) {\n            ans = (ans + query((int)val, cnt2 + 1)) % MOD;\n            cnt2 += cnt2;\n        } else {\n            cnt2++;\n            long diff = (cnt2 - val) % MOD2;\n            if (diff < 0) diff += MOD2;\n            ans = (ans + (int)diff) % MOD;\n            int start = (val != 0) ? 0 : 1;\n            for (int i = start; i < 10; ++i) {\n                if (val * 10 + i <= n) {\n                    dfs2(val * 10 + i);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00024077377747744322, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.0005964645533822477, -2.610649426060263e-05, -0.22542309761047363, -0.3134136199951172, -0.0003526780928950757, -1.9788545614574105e-05, -2.169585604860913e-05, -0.00014506718434859067, -2.9682672902708873e-05, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -